# shadcn instructions

Use the latest version of Shadcn to install new components, like this command to add a button component:

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add button
```

# Portfolio AI skills

Use the three-level skill system in `docs/skills/` (see `docs/skills/README.md`).

1. Level 1 is always in effect (`docs/skills/level-1/`).
2. Load only required Level 2 (`docs/skills/level-2/`) and Level 3 (`docs/skills/level-3/`) skills for the current task.
3. Dependency flow: Level 3 → Level 2 → Level 1 (never reverse).
4. Product vision: `.doc/The_Network_Portfolio_Blueprint.md`. Stack truth: TanStack Start + React (see `docs/decisions/ADR-001-tanstack-start.md`).
